@model WebApp.ViewModels.ExcelImport.ExcelImportRuntimeRowsViewModel
@inject Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Localization.IHtmlLocalizer<SharedResources> SharedLocalizer
@using WebApp.Services.ExcelImport

@{
    var headers = Model.Headers ?? new List<string>();
    var rows = Model.Rows;
    var filteredCount = Model.FilteredCount;
    var filterKey = System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.Replace(Model.AggregateKey ?? "import", "[^A-Za-z0-9_-]", "-");
    var filterId = $"excel-runtime-filter-invalid-loaded-{filterKey}";
    var pageStart = filteredCount == 0 ? 0 : ((Model.Page - 1) * Model.PageSize) + 1;
    var pageEnd = filteredCount == 0 ? 0 : Math.Min(Model.Page * Model.PageSize, filteredCount);
    var emptyColumnHeaders = headers
        .Where(header => rows.All(row =>
            row.Data == null
            || !row.Data.TryGetValue(header, out var cellValue)
            || string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(cellValue)))
        .ToHashSet(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
}

<div class="excel-runtime-status-table-title">@SharedLocalizer["ExcelImport_RuntimeImportedRows"]</div>
<div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 flex-wrap mb-2">
    <div class="form-check">
        <input class="form-check-input"
               type="checkbox"
               id="@filterId"
               data-runtime-loaded-filter-invalid="true"
               @(Model.ShowOnlyInvalidRows ? "checked" : null) />
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="@filterId">
            Visa endast rader med fel
        </label>
    </div>
    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.EditUrl))
    {
        <a href="@Model.EditUrl" class="btn btn-sm btn-portal btn-portal-outline">
            Redigeringsläge
        </a>
    }
</div>

<div class="excel-runtime-row-pager small text-muted mb-2"
     data-runtime-loaded-pager="true"
     data-runtime-page="@Model.Page"
     data-runtime-page-size="@Model.PageSize"
     data-runtime-total-pages="@Model.TotalPages"
     data-runtime-show-invalid="@(Model.ShowOnlyInvalidRows.ToString().ToLowerInvariant())"
     data-runtime-show-all="@(Model.ShowAllRows.ToString().ToLowerInvariant())">
    <span data-runtime-loaded-page-info>
        @(filteredCount > 0 ? $"Visar {pageStart}-{pageEnd} av {filteredCount} rader" : "Inga rader att visa")
    </span>
    @if (Model.ShowAllRows)
    {
        <span class="ms-2" data-runtime-loaded-page-indicator>Sida @Model.Page av @Model.TotalPages</span>
    }
</div>

<div class="table-responsive excel-runtime-status-table-wrap">
    <table class="table table-sm align-middle excel-runtime-status-table mb-0">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">@SharedLocalizer["ExcelImport_RuntimeRow"]</th>
                @foreach (var header in headers)
                {
                    var isEmptyColumn = emptyColumnHeaders.Contains(header);
                    var widthChars = isEmptyColumn ? Math.Clamp(header.Length, 4, 14) : 10;
                    <th scope="col" class="@(isEmptyColumn ? "excel-empty-column" : "")" style="--excel-col-ch:@widthChars;">@header</th>
                }
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            @if (rows.Count == 0)
            {
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="@(headers.Count + 1)" class="text-muted small">Inga rader matchar filtret.</td>
                </tr>
            }
            @foreach (var row in rows)
            {
                <tr class="@(row.IsValid ? "row-valid" : "row-invalid")">
                    <td>
                        <span class="excel-runtime-status-row-no">#@row.RowNo</span>
                        @if (!row.IsValid)
                        {
                            <span class="badge bg-danger-subtle text-danger rounded-pill ms-2">@SharedLocalizer["RuntimeStatus_Failed"]</span>
                        }
                    </td>
                    @foreach (var header in headers)
                    {
                        string? cellValue = null;
                        var hasValue = row.Data != null && row.Data.TryGetValue(header, out cellValue);
                        cellValue = hasValue ? cellValue : string.Empty;
                        var isEmptyColumn = emptyColumnHeaders.Contains(header);
                        var widthChars = isEmptyColumn ? Math.Clamp(header.Length, 4, 14) : 10;
                        <td class="@(isEmptyColumn ? "excel-empty-column" : "")" style="--excel-col-ch:@widthChars;">@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(cellValue) ? "—" : cellValue)</td>
                    }
                </tr>
                @if (!row.IsValid)
                {
                    <tr class="excel-row-error-row">
                        <td colspan="@(headers.Count + 1)">
                            <span class="excel-row-error-message">
                                <i class="fa fa-exclamation-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                @(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(row.ErrorMessage) ? "Raden klarade inte valideringen." : row.ErrorMessage)
                            </span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                }
            }
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="excel-runtime-row-pager-actions d-flex align-items-center gap-2 flex-wrap mt-2">
    @if (Model.ShowAllRows)
    {
        <button type="button"
                class="btn btn-sm btn-portal btn-portal-outline"
                data-runtime-loaded-row-prev="true"
                @(Model.Page <= 1 ? "disabled" : null)>
            Föregående
        </button>
        <button type="button"
                class="btn btn-sm btn-portal btn-portal-outline"
                data-runtime-loaded-row-next="true"
                @(Model.Page >= Model.TotalPages ? "disabled" : null)>
            Nästa
        </button>
    }
    @if (!Model.ShowAllRows && filteredCount > Model.PageSize)
    {
        <button type="button"
                class="btn btn-sm btn-portal"
                data-runtime-loaded-row-all="true">
            Visa alla rader
        </button>
    }
    else if (Model.ShowAllRows)
    {
        <button type="button"
                class="btn btn-sm btn-portal btn-portal-outline"
                data-runtime-loaded-row-preview="true">
            Visa 50 rader
        </button>
    }
</div>
